摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Unlock DeepSeek Harness plugin-native core capabilities, unifying Runtime, Provider, Plugin, Skill and MCP orchestration to build an extensible, composable and manageable local AI runtime platform.","id":"gh:1352120796","install_available":false,"language":"Rust","name":"dsh-launcher","slug":"rootkiller6788/dsh-launcher","topics":["cordis","cordis-plugin","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Unlock DeepSeek Harness plugin-native core capabilities, unifying Runtime, Provider, Plugin, Skill a"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"nd MCP orchestration to build an extensible, composable and manageable local AI runtime platform."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Launcher"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"The local runtime and ecosystem manager for DeepSeek Harness — one place for runtimes, instances, mo"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"del providers, plugins, skills, MCP, and launch environments."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"No manual environment setup. Works out of the box. The desktop shell is only one way to drive it; ru"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ntimes, instances, and ecosystem content are managed by DSHL."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness Launcher integrates the DeepSeek Harness local Web UI, host services, and plugin sy"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"stem into a native desktop application. It owns the window, the tray, the runtime, the work configur"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ation, and updates, and composes with upstream capabilities through the plugin mechanism DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"rness provides. It pins and runs a specific upstream version as-is — no fork, no changes to upstream"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"ides. It pins and runs a specific upstream version as-is — no fork, no changes to upstream behavior."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Download and install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Installers are currently available for Windows x64 (Ubuntu support is coming). No extra runtime requ"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ired — download, install, and use."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Platform | Download | Install |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Windows x64 | Download the installer | Run the NSIS installer and follow the prompts |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Building from source"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Requirements: Node ≥ 22, pnpm ≥ 10, Rust (MSVC toolchain), WebView2 (already present on Windows 11)."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **A runtime that works out of the box** — Node 22 ships inside the installer; DSH is resolved thro"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ugh a four-layer chain (settings override → bundled → managed `runtimes/<ver>/` → PATH). No Node, no"},{"id":"p14s3","text":" pnpm, no source checkout.\n- **Managed runtimes** — install, switch, delete, and verify multiple DSH"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" versions side by side; each instance is pinned to its own version.\n- **Multi-instance isolation** —"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" every instance gets its own `$DSH_HOME`; plugins and configuration never bleed between instances. C"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"reate, rename, clone, delete, switch.\n- **Model providers** — API keys live in Windows Credential Ma"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"nager and never touch disk in plaintext; a built-in provider library plus model catalog sync.\n- **Pl"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"ugin marketplace** — five catalogs (plugins / skins / skills / MCP / bundles); registry browsing, sm"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"art (LLM-reranked) search, and install / uninstall / hot enable-disable through the `cordis.patch.ym"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"l` layer, which survives reconciliation by `dsh plugin`.\n- **MCP ecosystem** — probe detection at in"},{"id":"p14s11","text":"stall time, config gaps made explicit (two signals: a self-reported degraded state and a 0-tool coun"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"t), a config dialog to fill them in, and values stored in the OS credential store and injected into "},{"id":"p14s13","text":"the launch environment.\n- **Embedded DSH window** — DSH renders inside the launcher's own window rat"},{"id":"p14s14","text":"her than a browser tab; closing the window stops the harness.\n- **Two-way theme sync** — light / dar"},{"id":"p14s15","text":"k / follow system, one switch: change it on either side, the launcher or DSH, and both follow.\n- **H"},{"id":"p14s16","text":"ardened process tree** — Windows Job Objects (`KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE`) + recursive `taskkill /T /F` as a"},{"id":"p14s17","text":" fallback + a pre-launch zombie sweep. Ten consecutive start/stop cycles leave zero residue.\n- **Lau"},{"id":"p14s18","text":"nch history** — sessions recorded in SQLite with start and end timestamps and crash / exit status."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"1. **Install** and launch AI Harness Launcher.\n2. **Preferences → Providers** — paste your DeepSeek "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"API key (stored in Windows Credential Manager).\n3. **Home** — pick an instance and click **Launch**."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"DSH starts in its own window; the Activity panel streams stdout/stderr live. Click the same button —"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" or close the window — to stop it."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**The language boundary is deliberate:** TypeScript owns the UI; Rust owns the system (processes, fi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"lesystem, network, secrets, SQLite). Every system action goes through typed Tauri IPC — see `CONTRIB"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"network, secrets, SQLite). Every system action goes through typed Tauri IPC — see `CONTRIBUTING.md`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Data directory"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"By default everything lives under `%LOCALAPPDATA%/AIHarnessLauncher/`. In **portable (green) mode** "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"the root is the directory holding the exe — drop the exe (with its bundled resources) anywhere and e"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"very byte stays next to it, so the whole launcher can travel on a USB stick."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Environment variables"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Variable | Purpose |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `AHL_HOME` | Override the data root (defaults to `%LOCALAPPDATA%/AIHarnessLauncher`; development /"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" testing) |\n| `AHL_PORTABLE` | Set to a truthy value (`1`, `yes`, `on`, …) to force portable mode: d"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ata root = the exe's own directory |\n| `DSH_CLI_BIN` | Override the DSH CLI entry (`…/apps/cli/lib/b"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"= the exe's own directory |\n| `DSH_CLI_BIN` | Override the DSH CLI entry (`…/apps/cli/lib/bin.js`) |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Portable (green) mode"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Create an empty `portable` (or `.portable`) file next to the launcher exe and the next launch switch"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"es to portable mode: `runtimes/`, `instances/`, `settings.json`, `cache/`, `logs/`, and `launcher.db"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"` all land beside the exe. Delete the marker to return to the per-user layout. The active mode is vi"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"sible under Preferences → Data storage. API keys always stay in Windows Credential Manager and do no"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"t travel with the folder."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"PRs are welcome — start with `CONTRIBUTING.md` (branch / commit conventions, PR flow, code and test "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"come — start with `CONTRIBUTING.md` (branch / commit conventions, PR flow, code and test standards)."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"MIT © 2026 dsh-launcher contributors."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
